* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_scapin (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): the IN rows of
* EQL_SCAP (prepret.dsc L105-107; M1.3 change 48, docs/m13-plan.md), "salvage limited by
* activity": with an operating life NCAP_OLIFE, a vintage's cumulative activity, in capacity
* units, divided by NCAP_OLIFE is at most its capacity left after early retirements. Added to
* TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0).
* - PRC_RCAP turns early retirement on for the coal plant ELCTECOA00 in REG1 and the new gas
*   plant ELCTNGAS01 in both regions (prepret.dsc L17 gives them the RCAP_BND 'N' option).
* - ELCTNGAS01 is vintaged (PRC_VINT): its milestone vintages keep NCAP_OLIFE (12 in REG1;
*   15 in REG2, interpolated to 20 by 2030, prepret.dsc L28). Its technical life is 30 years at
*   an availability of 0.85, so at most 25.5 full-load years: the limits bind if it runs.
* - ELCTECOA00 is not vintaged: L129 clears NCAP_OLIFE on its milestone vintages, so only the
*   past vintage 1995 added here (NCAP_PASTI 3, NCAP_OLIFE 20) has an IN row, whose activity
*   terms VAR_ACT(REG1,1995,T,ELCTECOA00,S) no other row has.
* - L29: NCAP_ELIFE takes the NCAP_OLIFE values where no NCAP_ELIFE is given.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET PRC_RCAP
/
REG1.ELCTECOA00
REG1.ELCTNGAS01
REG2.ELCTNGAS01
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_PASTI ' '/
REG1.1995.ELCTECOA00 3
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_OLIFE ' '/
REG1.1995.ELCTECOA00 20
REG1.2006.ELCTNGAS01 12
REG2.2006.ELCTNGAS01 15
REG2.2030.ELCTNGAS01 20
/
